Annual Meeting of Shareholders
March 7, 2023 9:00 AM Beijing Time
This proxy is solicited by the Board of Directors
The shareholder(s) hereby appoint(s) Shasha Mi and Sheng Gong, or either of them, as proxies, each with the
power to appoint (his/her) substitute, and hereby authorize(s) them to represent and to vote, as designated on
the reverse side of this ballot, all of the ordinary shares of BAOSHENG MEDIA GROUP HOLDINGS LIMITED
that the shareholder(s) is/are entitled to vote at the Annual Meeting of Shareholders to be held at 9:00 AM Beijing
Time, on March 7, 2023, at www.virtualshareholdermeeting.com/BAOS2023, and any adjournment or
postponement thereof.
